for most operations you need to down_read(mm_sem) ie., a read lock

for pte updates you need PTE lock. There are two types depending upon a build configuration:
<a> single global lock per address space called page_table_lock

<b> last level page tables's per page lock  
http://lxr.linux.no/linux+v2.6.37/include/linux/mm.h#L1100
<refer #if USE_SPLIT_PTLOCKS>

so if your last level page table spans across 4 struct pages then there will be 4 separate
locks.


